  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"对于SPI订阅任务，支持「App维度」/「订阅任务维度」管理推送账户列表；对于RDS订阅任务，支持「订阅任务维度」管理推送账户列表，暂不支持「App维度」。需配合【获取APP Access Token】接口使用。\",\"id\":\"subscribe.accounts.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/subscribe/accounts/list/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1818567348129040\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get.app.access.token\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1713655428885516\",\"reason\":\"请求时需要通过该接口获取应用级token\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取APP Access Token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1818567348129040\",\"title\":\"查询订阅 Adv\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-e2M62CWC\">对于SPI订阅任务，支持「App维度」/「订阅任务维度」管理推送账户列表</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-voSgjY2V\">对于RDS订阅任务，支持「App维度」/「订阅任务维度」管理推送账户列表</p><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1764048749711431%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%226kjCN%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-ksio93Fh\" id=\"h346b9f0-ksio93Fh\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-6JKlp6ZR\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/subscribe/accounts/list/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/subscribe/accounts/list/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1818567348129040\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-5AqlpIj4\" id=\"h346b9f0-5AqlpIj4\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-lgLqI2T8\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-XYdcRLAA\" id=\"h346b9f0-XYdcRLAA\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">App-Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">应用级token，区别于普通的Access Token，通过【<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1713655428885516\">获取APP Access Token</a>】接口获取</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">APP-Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-M3MDWDlm\" id=\"h346b9f0-M3MDWDlm\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">app_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">开放平台调用MAP所使用的APPID</span></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">subscribe_task_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1CD3uP5M\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">订阅任务ID</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-nwNFE4bK\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">注意：当subscribe_package_type=</span><code>TASK</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">时生效且必填</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">core_user_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dsQDPwru\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">授权用户ID</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">events</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hb3xxlwZ\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">账号ID</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">statuses</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> <span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">推送状态，</span>可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-3iec2ezkvf6000\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-aLBT6Mft\"><code>OK</code> 推送中</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Rn3ILQJA\"><code>PENDING</code> 新增状态</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-NHGc7CCp\"><code>UNAUTHORIZED</code> 无权限</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-isTadaqa\"><code>UNKNOWN</code> 未知</li></ul><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3krkv84vhbi000\">PS：subscribe_package_type=<code>APP</code> APP维度，不支持筛选</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">cursor</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UV8y2doN\">游标，默认值 0</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">count</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bhq41SMU\">页大小，默认 100， 最大值 500</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">subscribe_package_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">自定义订阅账户包类型，可选值:<p data-id=\"p838747a-eomieZWj\"></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Rmge1k1P\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-vks5WvO8\"><code>APP</code> APP维度</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-U3R2FkPr\"><code>TASK</code>订阅任务维度，默认</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-EUnjSq3M\"></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">source</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">账户来源，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-DWfjV80p\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dHyLdewk\"><code>AUTO_ADD</code> 系统添加</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-pLTVga69\"><code>CUSTOM</code> 自定义添加</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">账户类型，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-oVdU16aa\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-54VqPK8r\"><code>ADVERTISER</code> 客户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Cm98vpJ0\"><code>AGENT</code> 代理商</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-1lxZlX4R\"><code>旧版巨量引擎工作台</code> 旧版巨量引擎工作台</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-bqjtQwPo\"><code>升级版巨量引擎工作台</code> 升级版巨量引擎工作台</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Janu8kjg\"><code>LOCAL_ADVERTISER</code> 本地推客户</li></ul></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-1GE5qmh7\" id=\"h346b9f0-1GE5qmh7\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Fsubscribe%2Faccounts%2Flist%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%20if%20isinstance(v%2C%20string_types)%20else%20json.dumps(v)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20args.items()%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH%2C%20query_string)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20app_id%20%3D%20APP_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20subscribe_task_id%20%3D%20SUBSCRIBE_TASK_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20events_list%20%3D%20EVENTS%5Cn%20%20%20%20events%20%3D%20json.dumps(events_list)%5Cn%20%20%20%20core_user_id%20%3D%20CORE_USER_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20advertiser_ids_list%20%3D%20ADVERTISER_IDS%5Cn%20%20%20%20advertiser_ids%20%3D%20json.dumps(advertiser_ids_list)%5Cn%20%20%20%20statuses_list%20%3D%20STATUSES%5Cn%20%20%20%20statuses%20%3D%20json.dumps(statuses_list)%5Cn%20%20%20%20cursor%20%3D%20CURSOR%5Cn%20%20%20%20count%20%3D%20COUNT%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20my_ar